id: create
name: Create
prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in the Craft Skill (or Medicine/Cooking for their relevant Basic Items)
# Any of them: a Craft for what it makes - each its own Skill - Medicine for [Med] Basic Items, Cooking
# for [Food] ones.
requiresSkill: craft, craftApparel, craftWeapons, craftVehicles, medicine, cooking
requiresRanks: 2
sessionLimit: 1
timeCost: Varies
# "The Time Cost for the Create Maneuver depends on what you are trying to create."
timeBasic: 8 Hours
timeWeapon: 1 Day
timeApparel: 1 Day
timeVehicle: 5 Days
# What, the Check, what it costs, and the card: asked when it is used.
creates: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Craft Check - Medicine or Cooking for their Basic Items - at what you make's Difficulty: 8 hours for a
  Basic Item, a day for a Weapon or Apparel, five for a Vehicle. Made, it is yours; failed, try again for
  the time.
text: >
  Create: You craft an item from base components, creating something with function and purpose.
  –Prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in the Craft Skill (or Medicine/Cooking for their relevant Basic Items)
  –Session Limit: 1
  –Time Cost: Varies
  –Effect: Make a Craft Skill Check using the relevant Specialty for what you are trying to create (Basic
  Item/Weapon/Apparel/Vehicle), against the Difficulty Category listed by what you are attempting to
  create. If you succeed, you gain the item. If you fail, you may pay the Time Cost to try again.

  The Time Cost for the Create Maneuver depends on what you are trying to create:

  * Basic Item. 8 hours.
  * Weapon. 1 day.
  * Apparel. 1 day.
  * Vehicle/Battle Jacket. 5 days.

---

# Offered on the Adventure tab to whoever has 2+ Ranks in Craft, Medicine or Cooking. Used: what is made
# is picked among what they can make - a Basic Item with a Craft DC (Craft with the Basic Items Specialty;
# [Med] with Medicine, [Food] with Cooking), or a Weapon, Apparel, Vehicle or Battle Jacket (Craft with its
# Specialty). What it costs is paid once: Scrap for [Tech] and Vehicles, 1 to 6 by Difficulty, doubled for
# a Battle Jacket (the user's ruling: not paid again on a retry); an Ingredient for [Food], every attempt.
# The card states the Check - rolled from the sheet, where Craft's Auto-Succeed applies - with Made it,
# Try again (the same Create, another Time Cost: no second use) and Give up. Made, a Basic Item is given
# as the Gear tab gives one, recording its maker's Ingenuity; a Weapon, Apparel, Vehicle or Battle Jacket
# is only said (the user's ruling) - built on the Gear tab, or the table's.
